@startuml SystemResourceProvider
!include theme.puml

title SystemResourceProvider (SRP) - Static Accessors\nForwards to SystemInitializer and globals (ServiceContainer removed)

class SystemResourceProvider <<static accessors>> {
    {static} + getTaskManager(): TaskManager&
    {static} + getLogger(): Logger&
    {static} + getHealthMonitor(): HealthMonitor*
    {static} + getRuntimeStorage(): RuntimeStorage*
    {static} + getSyslog(): Syslog*
    ====
    {static} + getMB8ART(): MB8ART*
    {static} + getRYN4(): RYN4*
    {static} + getANDRTF3(): ANDRTF3*
    {static} + getDS3231(): DS3231Controller*
    ====
    {static} + getBurnerSystemController(): BurnerSystemController*
    {static} + getHeatingControl(): HeatingControlModule*
    {static} + getWheaterControl(): WheaterControlModule*
    {static} + getPIDControl(): PIDControlModule*
    {static} + getMQTTManager(): MQTTManager*
    {static} + getFlameDetection(): FlameDetection*
    {static} + getEthernetManager(): EthernetManager*
    ====
    {static} + getSensorReadings(): SharedSensorReadings&
    {static} + getRelayReadings(): SharedRelayReadings&
    {static} + getSystemSettings(): SystemSettings&
    ====
    {static} + event group and event bit getters
    {static} + getSensorReadingsMutex(), getRelayReadingsMutex()
    {static} + getSystemSettingsMutex(), getMQTTMutex()
    {static} + getDeviceMapMutex()
}

class SystemInitializer {
    + initializeSystem(): Result<void>
    --
    initializeLogging()
    initializeSharedResources()
    initializeHardware()
    initializeModbusDevices()
    initializeNetworkAsync()
    initializeControlModules()
    initializeMQTT()
    initializeTasks()
    --
    + getMB8ART(), getRYN4(), getANDRTF3(), getDS3231()
    + getBurnerSystemController(), getHeatingControl()
    + getWheaterControl(), getPIDControl(), getMQTTManager()
}

class "Globals" as Globals {
    sharedSensorReadings
    sharedRelayReadings
    currentSettings
    taskManager
    gHealthMonitor
    gRuntimeStorage
    gSystemInitializer
}

class BurnerControlTask
class HeatingControlTask

SystemResourceProvider ..> SystemInitializer : device and module getters\nforward to gSystemInitializer
SystemResourceProvider ..> Globals : shared data, TaskManager,\nHealthMonitor, RuntimeStorage

BurnerControlTask ..> SystemResourceProvider : SRP::getBurnerSystemController()
HeatingControlTask ..> SystemResourceProvider : SRP::getHeatingControl()\nSRP::getSensorReadings()

note right of SystemInitializer
  initializeSystem() order:
  1. Logging
  2. Shared resources (event groups, mutexes)
  3. Hardware (I2C, FRAM, RTC)
  4. Modbus devices
  5. Network (Ethernet, async)
  6. Control modules
  7. MQTT
  8. Tasks
  19 FreeRTOS tasks are started in total
  (TaskInitializer, main.cpp and task modules).
  On failure main.cpp calls enterFailsafeMode()
  and blinks LED_BUILTIN.
end note

note bottom of SystemResourceProvider
  getFlameDetection() and getEthernetManager()
  return nullptr; EthernetManager is used via
  EthernetManager::getInstance().
  Not present: getSharedResourceManager,
  getQueueManager, getModbusCoordinator,
  getPersistentStorage, getWaterControl.
  Thread safety of the accessors: not verified.
end note

@enduml
